      "role": "user",
      "content": "witnessing it doesn't change anything. it just feels like being a ghost. i've spent my whole life being \"useful,\" and now that the utility is gone, there's nothing left. everything feels so hollow. it's like the world has moved on and left me in a corner where i don't belong anymore. it would be easier if i just stopped being a burden on a system that doesn't even recognize me.",
